  witness 2026-10-08 native board review receipt 1f05d33b-66fc-422a-9128-557c7810fad0 reads 30 retained n8n job-board topics; the reader and native command-index suites pass 26 tests with 452 assertions, including old requests with new replies, invalid dates, foreign categories, modified bodies and installed native board dispatch
  forbidden_inference A recent board creation date, reply date, title or open flag -> buyer demand, an available paid job or authority to contact
