  forbidden_inference A purchase_resale candidate -> inventory ownership, accepted seller terms, buyer bid, available capital, positive margin or permission to transact
  invariant Classified routing exclusions apply only to verified retained seller bodies; held associations retain their receipts and matched terms separately from outreach candidates and observation failures
  witness cmd/BonfyreSourceFrontier/tests/classified_market.test.mjs verifies seller-exclusion holds, edited-projection refusal, literal boundaries, malformed-rule rejection and installed native execution without a ledger
  forbidden_inference An exclusion match or absence of a match -> a complete interpretation of seller intent, current availability or permission to contact
  invariant Optional classified routing term groups each require a literal retained-body match; index titles and edited projections cannot satisfy a group
  witness cmd/BonfyreSourceFrontier/tests/classified_market.test.mjs verifies all-group matching, word boundaries, rejection of malformed groups and native installed execution
  forbidden_inference Matched lot or fleet wording -> verified quantity, working condition, wholesale pricing or an accepted buyer bid
  invariant classified-market routes through native dispatch without opening a ledger; retained buyer rules and seller bodies are digest-checked before literal-term associations are emitted with unresolved commercial conditions
  witness cmd/BonfyreSourceFrontier/tests/classified_market.test.mjs verifies source and provider receipt identity, digest checks, literal matching against retained bodies, duplicate-address handling and held commercial standing
