  invariant A classified index must declare exactly one canonical URL matching the requested origin, path and category before its rows inherit a demand or supply label; HTTP success alone is insufficient.
  invariant Offline classified replay checks each retained body digest and records category mismatch or drift as a refused index with zero contributed rows; original evidence is not rewritten.
