  edge_types listed_by_inventory
  edge_types read_by_census_row
  edge_types contributed_to_surface
  invariant an address is canonical before it is counted: scheme and host lowercased, a leading www dropped, a default port and tracking parameters removed, one trailing slash dropped, and the address as it was written kept beside it; two inventories listing the same endpoint are one channel
  invariant one publisher is one root however many inventories listed it, and every inventory that listed a root or channel keeps its label on it, so the report states roots and channels listed by more than one inventory rather than summing the inventories
  invariant a channel's state may rise as the estate learns (shadow, candidate, eligible, waiting_credential, admitted, active) and never falls silently; a refusal is written beside the state so a refused channel stays in the count with its reason
  invariant a link found inside a retained body enters as shadow with truth_level observed_link_candidate; it has not been asked for, no robots rule has been checked for it and it is not a source
  invariant a catalogue's declared members are virtual channels counted in their own column, so the ledger may hold hundreds of thousands of generated channels without claiming that many active sources
  invariant only the census admits: a channel becomes admitted because a published internet_source row reads it, and a census row nothing listed becomes its own channel rather than being lost
  invariant one endpoint may be read by several census rows; readers are many-to-many, so three feeds reading one address are three readers of one channel
  invariant a channel becomes active only through a page contribution receipt, which says what a public route would show now, by source; a receipt measures this estate's surfaces and never a reader
  invariant a gap whose measurements do not exist reads UNMEASURED rather than being given a value
  invariant a publisher is a lattice, not a URL: what its own body links, what its publishing grammar addresses (WordPress, Ghost, Drupal, CivicPlus, Blogger, Substack, Discourse) and what its editorial archives imply all enter as separate channels, each carrying which of the three it is -- observed_link_candidate, observed_index_candidate or protocol_derived_candidate -- and all of them SHADOW until asked
  invariant a candidate becomes a source only by answering: the qualifier asks it through the observer, and admits it only if a feed parses, carries three items with titles, has published inside the freshness window and reads as English (stated, or evidenced by its own words), or a calendar holds three events with one still to come; everything else keeps its channel with the reason it was refused
  invariant a qualified channel joins the family its publisher is already filed under; where the estate has never filed that publisher, a feed is news rather than anything local, and a comment thread on one article is refused as not a channel
  invariant the forward plan values a gap only by what is counted -- channels at that root, items a page has shown, surfaces reached, and for an identity gap the number of roots sharing its name -- and prints UNMEASURED for everything else
  invariant a free closure is preferred before anyone is asked for anything: Wikidata's own statement of which organization owns a host names a root, and a body's own links name its machine channels, both at no cost and with no contact
  invariant the ledger is walkable rather than merely counted: the publishers, one publisher's families, and every channel in one family are each a bounded page with its own address, and each channel states its standing (read and shown, read here, answered, waiting for a key, named by something retained, listed, or refused with its reason)
  invariant a static ledger carries the whole admitted census and its bounded admitted index as WebAddress coordinates; it does not promote the candidate census merely because an object store can hold it
  invariant a static source coordinate is semantic routing state, never a required filesystem or object leaf; an oversized coordinate lowers through its canonical-query digest to a carrier-safe material key
  invariant the finite admitted-source static manifest is compiled natively from a read-only Frontier snapshot using the shared query encoder and SHA-256; candidate channels and channels without a census source do not enter the export
  invariant an attention level is a reading plan; it is never permission to fetch, buy, contact or enrol, and no outreach, purchase or enrolment is performed anywhere in this organ
  invariant a decision-model source-program assessment is a receipt-bound diagnostic plan over already-admitted descriptors; it cannot alter source standing, rights, public program membership, authority, payment, or any effect
  forbidden_inference a listed channel -> a lawful, callable, credentialed, licensed or available source
  forbidden_inference an admitted channel -> one a person ever saw; that is what the contribution receipt is for
  forbidden_inference a starved source -> a bad source; starvation names a surface, join or aperture this estate has not built
  forbidden_inference a gap's resolution class -> a decision to take it, or permission to contact anyone
  forbidden_inference a virtual channel -> an observation, a retained body or admitted evidence
  forbidden_inference the ledger's channel count -> the number of sources this estate reads
  forbidden_inference a static source-ledger coordinate -> a live endpoint, an item retained from it, or a claim beyond that channel's recorded standing
  known_gap the ledger counts what inventories and catalogues declare; robots, rights, schema, cadence and reachability are probed only for the channels the census already reads
  known_gap the qualifier reads a feed's shape and language, never its quality: a channel that parses and is fresh is admitted whatever it publishes
  known_gap an economic interface (affiliate, partner, referral) is a column on a root that nothing yet fills; no provider relationship is declared, enrolled or applied anywhere
  known_gap gap valuation is structural (how many channels a root has, how often they contributed); the closure dividend the target describes -- branches eliminated, queries avoided, subject and scene reuse -- has no measurement yet and is reported UNMEASURED
  known_gap a root is a host with www dropped, not a registrable domain, so two hosts of one organization are two roots until an identity joins them
  known_gap catalog.data.gov answers 404 to package_search from this estate and its whole DCAT document is too large for one observation, so the national catalogue is declared and skipped rather than read
  known_gap the contribution receipt composes each route as the server would rather than recording what a served page contained; it measures the surface, not the traffic
