  witness 2026-09-18 on the estate the publisher lattice read 80 retained bodies, found 14 WordPress roots, one Blogger and one Discourse, and wrote 139 shadow channels; the qualifier asked 30 of them and admitted 10 (Deutsche Welle, France 24, the Guardian's India edition, the Times of India, the Hindu, NDTV and others), refusing per-article comment threads, feeds with nothing inside the window and feeds whose words do not read as English; the ledger stood at 4,912 exact channels with 128 shadow and 37 eligible, and the forward plan named qlever.dev as the most-used root with an open structured-channel gap (5 channels, 570 items shown across 5 surfaces)
