  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/source_frontier_accounting.test.mjs proves CUE-authored frontier accounting preserves exact channels, descriptor-only roots, state and evidence distinctions, and ordered gaps; the Bun output was also compared field-for-field with the prior Python compiler on this mixed fixture before archival
  invariant compatibility frontier accounting preserves source occurrences, rights and gaps without declaring native SourceFrontier admission or effect authority
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/recursive_channels.test.mjs proves retained-body links, WordPress candidate routes, archive feeds and sitemap locations preserve separate observed-link and protocol-derived truth without admission
  invariant the Source Fabric cycle runner and artifact names are compiled from one CUE contract; each optional step records either its successful exact owner call or the reason it was skipped, and never treats a candidate as an effect
  invariant candidate pressure consumes compiled Frontier root/channel state and family through exact occurrence provenance; a missing or ambiguous occurrence refuses instead of recreating the Python URL-family classifier
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/source_pressure.test.mjs proves exact candidate counts, ambiguous identity matches, and descriptor-only roots carry Frontier state and family without promoting pressure into contribution or authority
  invariant a FactDelta ForeignTwin write measures distinct reverse-dependency closures and published Scene joins only; it cannot establish visible source contribution, causality, rights, or effect authority
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/source_change_impact.test.mjs proves duplicate dependencies and unmapped topics are counted without promoting an unreceipted, unpublished, or non-ForeignTwin write into visible source reuse
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/source_fabric_cycle_impact.test.mjs proves the live Source Fabric cycle invokes the Bun change-impact compiler and produces measured reverse-dependency reuse without inferring Scene visibility
  source_path cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tools/compile_scene_source_receipts.mjs
