  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/source_attention_sync.test.mjs proves dry-run plans never call the native Attention binary and valid live plans pass bounded explicit argv without inferring fetch or effect authority
  invariant Source Attention thresholds are authored in CUE and may be overridden as explicit run policy; temperature only schedules a reading plan and cannot itself trigger observation or spending
  source_path cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tools/compile_source_forward.mjs
