  invariant the Source Forward scorer reads benefit, cost, relationship, and disclosure law from the authored CUE policy; a gap owner's resolution order passes through unchanged and no prose recommendation is synthesized by the compiler
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/source_forward.test.mjs proves measured SourceGap dividends and commercial relationship proposals remain candidate-only and require human approval and identity disclosure
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/source_attention.test.mjs proves independent pressure, reverse-impact, and gap signals compile to hot, warm, cool, and cold reading plans without granting fetch, spend, or source contribution authority
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/source_starvation.test.mjs proves separately authored starvation diagnostics can coexist per SourceRoot without promoting pressure, Scene dependency, or severity to admission or authority
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/scene_legacy_sources.test.mjs proves the published legacy census cut reports its compatibility limit, dropped source IDs, and unmatched Scene roots without claiming visibility
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/scene_source_receipts.test.mjs proves a persisted Scene joins exact ForeignTwin closure dependencies to canonical source roots while keeping candidates and unresolved topics separate from visible source claims
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/scene_source_delta.test.mjs proves Scene source snapshots emit born, retired, and changed dependency receipts with per-root co-change counts while refusing to attribute cause or authority
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/commerce_family.test.mjs proves a returned storefront endpoint shape stays eligible-not-admitted and its public observer path refuses unreceipted answers while retaining receipted ones
  source_path scripts/probe_continuously.sh
